        {
          "text": "Erae ŋul ŋikisila ŋulu a ŋolokile daadaŋ elele ibore anakuwan ka ŋulu daadaŋ eleleete ŋaokot ŋuna ka aur ŋulu itoroniyaritae a ŋakiro a ŋun, ",
          "type": "text",
