        },
        {
          "text": "ŋikisila ŋulu a ŋinaberu daadaŋ a ŋina eyai lolap, ŋikisila ŋulu ke ekile, kori ka aberu a ŋina elele ibore anakuwan ka ŋulu ke ekile a ŋolo iryamakin ka aberu ŋina eriŋa eyai lolap.",
